Documentation media
-------------------
The PNG files under `docs-public/images/admin/` are local demonstration
captures supplied for this repository's documentation. They contain no
production endpoint, credential, customer data, or third-party branding claim.

The exact dependency graph for a build is generated by Maven. Before a release,
run `mvn dependency:tree -DoutputFile=target/dependency-tree.txt` and publish
that file with the release artifacts. Check each dependency's own NOTICE file
for the complete attribution text.
